claim.claim-text:
A self-contained linear ridge-and-valley megastructure constructed on degraded or marginal terrain (2200), comprising:
        (a) an aerodynamic ridge shell having exterior slopes covered by a living soil and vegetation radiation-shielding mantle (2202) at least 2.2 meters thick attenuating cosmic and solar radiation by at least 96%;
        (b) an open interior valley flanked by staggered sunlit residential terraces (2204) descending to a central valley park (2206);
        (c) a multi-level subterranean commerce and vertical-farming canyon (2208, 2210) disposed beneath said central valley park (2206) and housing an evacuated maglev transit and freight conduit (2214); and
        (d) a distributed array of Cool Power Core thermo-cavitation plasma modules (2212, 2302) thermally coupled between waste heat from said subterranean canyon (2208, 2210) and deep cold-sink heat exchangers (2216, 2304) to mineralize site wastewater into less than 1 ppm TDS distilled water (2306) while exporting net continuous electrical power (2308).

A method of rehabilitating ecologically degraded or non-arable land (2200) into a net-positive human settlement, comprising:
        (a) erecting a linear ridge-and-valley earth-sheltered superstructure over said degraded terrain (2200) with a living soil mantle (2202) exceeding 450 g/cm2 areal density;
        (b) routing contaminated site leachate, saline brine, and domestic blackwater (2300) through a 90 C graphene-vortex cavitator and 33.6 kV nanosecond pulsed plasma reactor (2302);
        (c) bridging process heat against sub-surface cold-sink piles (2216, 2304) to generate continuous electrical power (2308) exceeding total settlement demand; and
        (d) circulating recovered less than 1 ppm TDS distillate (2306) and conditioned 21.5 C air through subterranean vertical farms (2210) and sunlit terraced residences (2204).
